1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hendrik_van_Wassenberg
2 CONT
2 CONT Hendrik van Wassenberg (about 1151 - 4 dec 1214) was Mr. van Wassenberg from 1180 to 1212 together with his brother Gerard. He was the son of Hendrik III of Limburg and Sophie van Saarbrucken
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriages and children [ edit ] Hendrik was married in 1178 with Sophie van Gelre daughter of Hendrik I , Count of Gelre and Zutphen, and Agnes van Arnstein.
2 CONT
2 CONT Reinerus van Wassenberg Goswinus of Haasdal , (Lord of Haasdal 1217), Ministerial of the Monastery St. Gerlach (approx. 1194 - 1264 ) Hendrik van Haasdal ca.1192 - +1250, (Heer Schonhoven Schonau Richterich Schloss_Schönau Screens
2 CONC aver and Atvocatus of Haspengau) also named Heinrich von Aachen married to Alis de Warfusee (Abdij van Abdij van Nostre Dame 1223-1241, Vrou of Bretonbur) Will I from Haasdal +1259, (Ridder 1210, Lord of Abshoven and Molen (at the
2 CONC  Geleenbeek Oud Spaubeek) guardian of Oud Spaubeek) (1) married to Goderadis +1228 daughter of Engelbertus III of Horne and the sister of Dirk (van Horne ) guardian of true (vlg's ear) and the (2) married to Aleidis van Houte (Cor
2 CONC tessem) +1259 granddaughter of Rasso van Donmartin. The children were from the first marriage. Willem III of Horne owns Rasso 1277 Houte - Cortessem belonging to Horne previously and obtained via Loon. Gerard I of Printhagen (1st 
2 CONC Lord of Printhagen 1273-1278 in Genhout - Beek) Menta van Printhagen married to Henricus van Reterbeck (ancestor of Reterbeck). Got 1278 both of Walram 15 bunder from his loan at Beke (Spaubeek) and only landowners in Haasdal. The
2 CONC ir descendant Willem van Reterbeck later acquires his inheritance from his sister Gertudis who was married to Johan van Schaesberg (childless) and Schaesberg castle. Gerard II of Printhagen (Landcommandeur in Aldenbiesen 1265-1267
2 CONC ) Rasse van Printhagen (Lord of Printhagen) Rasse (Lord of Printhagen) Walraaf (Lord of Glene) Martin Willem II of Printhagen (1st Lord of Printhagen 1277 in Cortessem (Be) (Blood Brother of Rasso Van Houte (Cortessem) Tilmannus v
2 CONC an Printhagen Elisabeth van Printhagen married to Theodor van Cartils (Baron, 'dommer' of the chapter of Sint-Servaas in Maastricht, Eynenburg 1260) Antonius (leader) of Printhagen (Order Teutonic, Landcommanders of Bailiwick of U
2 CONC trecht 1232-1266) Agnes of Printhagen (Kanones at St. Ursula in Cologne) Sophy van Printhagen (Kanones tea Geringsheim) Anselmus van Haasdal (Heer in Haesdal) mentioned in 1253 Alard van Haasdal +1265 Godsdal in Aubel, (Ministeria
2 CONC l, Lord of Haesdal 1232-1264, Councilor of St.Gerlach.) Married to Agnes Johan I van Haasdal (Lord of Haesdal 1265) experiences it completely in Haasdal. Johan II of Haasdal (Milites, 1273 Lord of the Hafkesdale) Goswinus of Haasd
2 CONC al (Milites 1273 (Soldier)) Alardus van Haasdal Rutgerus Hendrik van Haasdal (Lord of Schaesberg and Gronsveld, Council of St. Gerlach ) (approx. 1223 - before 1265 ). Married to (1) Mechtildis of Rulant-Hozémont (ca. 1224 - 1252 
