2 CONC nates 1265 the fruit use Harer goods at Abshoven 1253 at the godsdal monastery at Aubel. Herman van Haasdal +1253 Adam I Haren , lord of Borgharen , governor of Maastricht in 1194 and the deanery of Meerssen , married to N. van Lo
