1 NAME Günther Il, count of Käfernburg-Schwarzburg und Hallermund
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1160
2 ADDR
3 CITY Schwarzburg
3 STAE Turingia
3 CTRY Germany
1 DEAT
