1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Irmengard von Baden1
2 CONT Last Edited	4 Apr 2020
2 CONT '''F, #18616, b. circa 1269, d. after 8 February 1320'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Rudolph 'the Great', Markgraf von Baden-Pforzheim2 d. 19 Nov 1288
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Kunigunde von Eberstein2 b. c 1227, d. 22 Apr 1290
2 CONT '''Irmengard von Baden was born circa 1269 at of Baden, Baden, Baden. She married Eberhard 'the Quarrelsome', Graf von Württemberg''', son of Ulric VI Pollex, Graf von Württemburg and Agnes von Liegnitz, '''before 21 June 1296.3 I
2 CONC rmengard von Baden died after 8 February 1320; Buried at Stuttgart.'''3
2 CONT '''Family	Eberhard 'the Quarrelsome', Graf von Württemberg''' b. 13 Mar 1265, d. 5 Jun 1325
2 CONT '''Children	'''
2 CONT *Agnes von Wuerttemburg+3 d. 18 Jan 1317
2 CONT *Ulric von Wurttemberg+ d. 1 Nov 1315
2 CONT *Irmgard von Wurttemberg3,4 d. 17 May 1329
2 CONT *Adelheid von Württemberg+3 b. c 1290, d. 13 Sep 1342
