2 CONT
2 CONT Eberhard, Graf von der Mark was the first born son of Engelbert I von der Mark and Kunigunde von Blieskastel.
2 CONT
2 CONT First he married Irmgard von Berg. Maria van Loon was his second wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1277 Count Herman van Loon kidnaps Count Engelbert I of Mark and holds him as a prisoner in the castle Bredevoort, where Engelbert dies of a heart attack. In 1278 Eberhard takes revenge and conquers Bredevoort ''(source: Biogra
2 CONC fisch Woordenboek der Nederlanden, 1865)''.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eberhard was involved in the [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Worringen Batlle of Worringen]
