2 CONT 1.         [HEINRICH] HUGO [XII] (-1178 or after).  1138/1178.  "Hugo comes de Dagsburc" donated the church of Antheit "in allodio meo de Musac" to Flône abbey by charter dated 1146[289].  “Comes Hugo de Dagesburc” reached agreeme
2 CONC nt with "abbas Novillarensis ecclesiæ" relating to land "Warthenbergensi castro adjacentia" by charter dated 1158[290].  The Annales Argentinenses record that "comite Hugone de Dagesburg" destroyed Horburg in 1162[291].  m (1143) 
2 CONC as her second husband, LUTGARDIS von Sulzbach, widow of GODEFROI VI Duke of Lower Lotharingia, daughter of BERENGAR [I] Graf von Sulzbach & his second wife Adelheid von Wolfratshausen (-after 1163).  The Genealogia Ducum Brabantiæ
2 CONC  Heredum Franciæ names "Ludgarde ducissa de Saltzebach" as the wife of "Godefridus…secundus dux"[292].  Her second marriage is suggested by the undated charter under which her son "Adelbertus…comes Metensis et de Dasbourch" appoin
2 CONC ted "nepotem meum ducem Lotharingiæ" as his heir "de castro meo Dasbourgh…"[293].  Hugo [XII] & his wife had four children: 
