2 CONT m -'''-- von Arnstein, daughter of LUDWIG [I] Graf von Arnstein & his wife ---.''' The Vita Lodewici comitis de Arnstein records that "in castro Arnstein…comes…Lodewicus" had seven sisters, of whom the fourth married "Nassauwen"[2
