2 CONT '''Stephen II''' (décédé en 1096) était un noble allemand et un des premiers membres de la maison de Sponheim . Il succéda à son père, Stephen Ier , comme comte de Sponheim vers 1080. Vers 1092, Stephen épousa Sophia de Formbach .
2 CONC  Stephen a eu plusieurs enfants avec Sophia, y compris Meginard I , qui lui a succédé comme comte de Sponheim.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Stephen II''' (died in 1096) was a German nobleman and one of the first members of Sponheim's house. He succeeded his father, Stephen I, as Earl of Sponheim by 1080. Around 1092, Stephen married Sophia of Formbach. Stephen had 
2 CONC several children with Sophia, including Meginard I, who succeeded him as Earl of Sponheim.
