2 CONT This title primarily refers to Fastre van Ghoer (also known as Fastre van Corswarem, born c. 1165, died c. 1190). He was a medieval nobleman and the son of Robert van Ghoer (Heer van Corswarem en Berlo) and Maria van Diest. Fastre
2 CONC  was married to Adelheid, the erfdochter (heiress) of Walram I of Limburg
