2 CONT *https://www.genealogieonline.nl/karens-family-tree/I197442.php  Bron: Stamboom I.D.M. de Vries, DatabaseStamboom ; Auteur Ger de Vries.
2 CONT *https://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00503563&tree=LEO shows three daughters by 2nd wife Elisabeth of Brabant: Elisabeth, Mathilde and Jutta von Wassenberg.
