1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Updated 26th May 2026 by W.J.E.W. to rectify 'orange dot' anomalies,
2 CONT 1.B; 2.D; 3.M; 4; corrected name spelling. 5;Inset missing Surname; 6. Suffix detected in name field.
2 CONT The word "Graf" translates to Count or Earl in English. It is a historical title of the German nobility ranking above a baron but below a duke
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT Lauretta von Blieskastel (1214–1269)
2 CONT ..
2 CONT Lauretta's father, Heinrich von Blieskastel, I, Graf von Blieskastel, was 34 and her mother, Agnes von Sayn, was 32 when she married Heinrich IV. von Salm on 12 February 1242, in Palatinate, Bavaria, Germany. They ...
2 CONT ----------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT Lauretta (born von Blieskastel) von Salm -  [Also Loretta]
2 CONT Birth:  '''1224'''   YEAR DATE IS CORRECT
2 CONT Death: '''September 1269''' -   DATE IS CORRECT
2 CONT Parents:  Heinrich von Blieskastel, I, Graf von Blieskastel and Countess Agnes (von Sayn) von Blieskastel
2 CONT [1st] Husband: Heinrich Von Salm [Heinrich IV, Graf von Salm] 
2 CONT Married: February 12 1242 (Lauretta was 18yrs)
2 CONT
2 CONT [2] Husband: Heinrich Graf von Rappoltstein ??????????????????
2 CONT Children: Johann I von Salm, Graf von Obersalm; Katharina von Salm; Heinrich von Salm; Friedrich von Salm/Obersalm, 3; Jeannette von Salm; and Ulrich III, Graf von Rappoltstein« less
2 CONT Siblings: Mechtild von Blieskastel; Kunigunde von Blieskastel von Schaumburg; Adelheid von Blieskastel; Imagina von Blieskastel; Elisabeth von Blieskastel; Johann von Blieskastel and Friedrich von Blieskastel« less 
2 CONT ------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT Lauretta married Heinrich Von Salm, on Feb 12 1242, at age 18 in marriage place. Heinrich was born in 1222, in birth place. They had 4 children: Johann I Salm and 3 more children
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/LOTHARINGIAN%20(LOWER)%20NOBILITY.htm#HeinrichIVSalmdied1292
2 CONT HEINRICH [IV] von Salm, son of HEINRICH von Salm & his wife Marguerite de Bar (-8 Jan 1292 or 8 Jun 1293).  
2 CONT *The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified.  
2 CONT *Richer records that in 1251 "dominum Henricum…de Salmis" was summoned before the court of the Bishop of Metz for the damage he had done to the church of Senone[297].  
2 CONT *He succeeded his grandfather as Graf von Salm.  
2 CONT *Graf von Bliescastel 1275.  
2 CONT *A charter dated 19 May 1284 records an agreement between the bishop of Metz and "Henri cuens de Salmes, Henris, Jehan et Ferris fill edit conte de Salmes" relating to "la contei de Caistres"[298]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT marries (1242, before 12 Feb) as her second husband, 
2 CONT
2 CONT LAURETTE von Bliescastel, widow of --- von Rappoltstein, daughter of HEINRICH Graf von Bliescastel & his wife --- (-Sep 1269).  
2 CONT *The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet been identified.  
2 CONT *Heiress of Hunolstein, Bernkastel and Püttlingen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Heinrich [IV] & his wife had children: 
2 CONT # HEINRICH von Salm (c1245-[14 May/4 Aug] 1288). 
2 CONT # JOHANN [I] von Salm (c1250-after 1330).  
2 CONT # KATHARINA [Johanna] von Salm (c1255 - after 1314).  
