1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *https://historytheinterestingbits.com/2017/01/15/the-unfortunate-wives-of-philip-ii-of-france/?fbclid=IwAR048J_P7VzlEyqz1krt-JjdzA0eJDBVP44IFsnPjpiqczAM66EPpdHymls
