2 CONC  Béla III of Hungary, who invested him with the government of the Principality of Halych. However, the boyars of Halych rebelled against his rule and expelled the Hungarian troops. Following their father's death, Andrew continuous
2 CONC ly conspired against his brother, King Emeric of Hungary who had to grant him the government of Croatia  and Dalmatia. When his brother and his infant son died, Andrew ascended the throne and started to grant royal domains to his 
