2 CONT      Andrew Arpád was the son of Andreas II Arpád, King of Hungary and Gertrud of Meran. (1) He married Helen of Novgorod, daughter of Mstislav Rurik, Prince of Novgorod, in 1221. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1234. (1)
