2 CONC me as a nun. ''Her husband was MOYS de Dáró'', Judge of the Kumans ([-end 1280)]),  Palatine of Hungary, Gespan of Sopron.  They had one child:  Erzsébet de Dáró◄ 
2 CONT *See: http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/HUNGARY.htm#AndrasIIA
