2 CONT Countess Adelheid of Tyrol was one of the two daughters of Count Albert (III) of Tyrol († 1253) from his marriage to Countess Ute of Lechsgemünd († around 1254), daughter of Count Heinrich (II) of Frontenhausen-Lechsgemünd († arou
2 CONC nd 1208). She was married (marriage between after 1230 and before September 29, 1237 [1] ) to Count Meinhard (III.) of Görz (as Count of Tyrol: Meinhard I.
