2 CONT '''Eberhard 'the Quarrelsome', Graf von Württemberg'''1,2
2 CONT Last Edited	4 Apr 2020
2 CONT '''M, #18615, b. 13 March 1265, d. 5 June 1325'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Ulric VI Pollex, Graf von Württemburg b. c 1226, d. 25 Feb 1265
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Agnes von Liegnitz b. 1245, d. 13 Mar 1265
2 CONT '''Eberhard 'the Quarrelsome', Graf von Württemberg was born on 13 March 1265 at of Stuttgart, Wurttemburg. He married Irmengard von Baden''', daughter of Rudolph 'the Great', Markgraf von Baden-Pforzheim and Kunigunde von Eberste
2 CONC in, '''before 21 June 1296.1 Eberhard 'the Quarrelsome', Graf von Württemberg died on 5 June 1325 at Stuttgart, Baden-Württemberg, Germany, at age 60; Buried there.'''1
2 CONT '''Family	Irmengard von Baden''' b. c 1269, d. a 8 Feb 1320
2 CONT '''Children	'''
