2 CONT ==Eberhard I Graf von Württemberg1 
2 CONT '''M, #151891, b. 13 March 1265, d. 5 June 1325'''
2 CONT Last Edited=19 Feb 2017
2 CONT '''Eberhard I Graf von Württemberg was born on 13 March 1265 at Stuttgart, Baden-Württemburg, Germany.2 He was the son''' of Ulrich I Graf von Württemberg and Matilde von Baden.1 '''He married, thirdly, Irmgard von Baden''', daugh
2 CONC ter of Rudolf I Markgraf von Baden and Kunigunde von Eberstein, '''on 21 June 1296.2 He died on 5 June 1325 at age 60.'''1,2
2 CONT '''Eberhard I Graf von Württemberg also went by the nick-name of Eberhard 'the Noble'.1 He succeeded as the Graf von Württemberg in 1279.'''1
2 CONT '''Children of Eberhard I Graf von Württemberg'''
2 CONT 1. Adelheid von Württemberg+3 d. 13 Sep 1342
2 CONT 2. Ulrich III Graf von Württemberg+1 d. 1344
2 CONT Citations
