2 CONT '''Crato II [de]''' ; Born c.1280 Son of Crato 1 [de] and Margaret Truendingen ; '''Consort Adelaide Matilda of Württemberg (1295/1300 - 13 September 1342) 1306 two children''' ; Death 8 May 1344 aged 63-64
