1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From 1679 to 1697 was Johann Jakob Waldbott of Bassenheim as a canon of Kurmainz governor in Erfurt , the secular rule since the years 1000 to 1802 also respect the Archbishop of Mainz was subordinate. 
