2 CONT ==(1)Jean Jacques Waldbott de Ferrette - (2)Johann Jakob Waldbott von Bassenheim==
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Waldbott von Bassenheim and de Merimont or von Moersberg==
2 CONT
2 CONT ==(3) seigneurie Jean de Merimont (German: von Moersberg)==
2 CONT
2 CONT (1) In the Lordship of Ferrette
2 CONT
2 CONT The capital of the ancient county of Ferrette was home for a long time of WALBOTT.
2 CONT
2 CONT  En 1643 et 1647 les frères de Luppach ont baptisés Jean Henri et François Georges, fils de Jean Jacques WALDBOOT de Ferrette et de son épouse Marie ORTSCHEID
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1643 and 1647 the brothers were baptized Luppach Jean François Henri and George, son of Jean Jacques WALDBOOT of Ferrette and his wife Marie ORTSCHEID.
2 CONT
