1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nesselrode
2 CONT
2 CONT House of Nesselrode is an ancient German noble family originating in the Duchy of Berg. Over the centuries, the family expanded their possessions through marriage with the most powerful families of the region. As a former ruling f
2 CONC amily they belonged to the small circle of High Nobility.
2 CONT
2 CONT The family was first recorded in September 1303 when its progenitor Knight Heinrich genannt Flecke von Nesselrode was mentioned as feudal lord of Deutz Abbey. Burg Nesselrath served as their first family seat. There were several b
2 CONC ranches of the family: Nesselrode-Reichenstein, Nesselrode-Ehreshoven and Nesselrode-Landscron and Nesselrode-Hugenpoēt. They were sovereign Counts of the immediate Lordship of Reichenstein.
