2 CONC  Mahat sa tante Ovieres”[312].  The father of “Isabeau” is identified as the husband of Petronilla de Dachsburg (see above).  If “sa tante” can be interpreted as maternal aunt, Mathilde would have been Petronilla´s sister.  “Ovier
2 CONC es” has not been identified.] 
