2 CONC director and Chief Magistrate of the Colonies on the South River of New Netherland 1655-1657''. Philadelphia, PA, US: Press of Allen Lane & Scott, p. 105. Available at: [https://www.google.com/books/edition/Allied_Ancestry_of_the_
2 CONC Van_Culemborg_Fam/8mIfAAAAMAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&bsq=%22Godfrey%20I%22 Google Books].
