2 CONC he soul of "Ermentrudis materteræ suæ comitissæ de Rupe", witnessed by "…Oto comes de Rupe præfate comitisse sponsus…"[13].  m EUDES de la Roche, son of SIMON Comte de la Roche & his wife --- (-after 6 Sep 1178). 
