2 CONC medeum Montis Beliardi et archiepiscopum Theodericum Bisuntinensem"[8].  The necrology of Besançon Saint-Etienne records the death in Apr 1148 of "Sophia uxor Richardi de Montefalcone"[9].  m ([1124/30]) RICHARD de Montfaucon, son
2 CONC  of AMEDEE Seigneur de Montfaucon & his wife --- de Neuchâtel (-1162). 
