1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dietrich (Theodoric) Schenk von Erbach (died 6 May 1459) was the Archbishop of Mainz from 1434 until 1459.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a cathedral member of Mainz when on 6 July 1434 he was elected its archbishop. Theodoric was confirmed by Pope Eugene IV on 20 October. At the Council of Basel Theodoric maintained a neutral position and tried to mediate be
2 CONC tween both sides. In 1439 he managed to get all the German princes and the King to recognise Eugene as the legal pope.
2 CONT
2 CONT Theodoric died in Aschaffenburg in 1459.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dietrich_Schenk_von_Erbach
