1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Bero I of Rechberg-Mindelheim=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Bero I of Rechberg-Mindelheim († 1462): founder of the Rechberg-Mindelheim branch; through his mother Irmgard of Teck († 1432) he inherited the lordship of Mindelheim in 1439 together with his siblings Albrecht and Barbara; in t
2 CONC he following years he bought off his siblings' shares; in 1447 he became sole owner of the lordship; married to Countess Barbara of Rottenburg († 1462); ancestor of Georg von Waldburg-Zeil (1488–1531) ; after his death the lordshi
2 CONC p of Mindelheim first passed to his sons Bero II and Jörg II, before it was sold in 1467 to his daughter Barbara, who was married to Ulrich von Frundsberg, with Mindelheim belonging to her descendants until 1586
2 CONT
