2 CONT '''KONRAD''', son of Graf POPPO [III] & his wife Mathilde --- .  "Cunradus filius comitis Bopponis de Loufo" recognised the rights of the church of Worms over property held by his father, by charter dated 18 May 1127[1344]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' GISELHILD von Arnstein, daughter of LUDWIG Graf von Arnstein & his wife ---.  The Vita Lodewici comitis de Arnstein records that "in castro Arnstein…comes…Lodewicus" had seven sisters, of whom the fifth married "comitis de
2 CONC  Loufo"[1345].  The primary source which confirms her name has not yet been identified. 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Konrad & his wife had two children: 
