2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-110775354 Gerlach II von Dollendorf herr zu Cronenberg (Dollendorf-Cronenberg), II von Dollendorf, Herr zu Cronenberg];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-56372252 Aleidis Dollendorf]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died circa 1279. 
