1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Elisabeth von Ziegenhain1,2,3
2 CONT Last Edited	7 Nov 2010
2 CONT F, #27622, d. 1 December 1431'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Godfrey VIII, Graf von Ziegenhain4 d. bt 1 Jan 1394 - 24 Sep 1394
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Agnes von Brunswick4 b. c 1349, d. a 13 Sep 1416
2 CONT Charts	14 Generation Pedigree of George III, King of Great Britain & Ireland
2 CONT '''A contract for the marriage of Elisabeth von Ziegenhain and Ulric V, Count von Hanau-Munzenberg was signed on 3 April 1379.2 Elisabeth von Ziegenhain married Ulric V, Count von Hanau-Munzenberg''', son of Ulric IV, Count von Ha
2 CONC nau-Munzenberg and Elisabeth von Wertheim, '''circa 19 February 1394.5,3 Elisabeth von Ziegenhain died on 1 December 1431.'''2,3
2 CONT '''Family	Ulric V, Count von Hanau-Munzenberg''' b. 1368, d. a 27 Oct 1416
2 CONT '''Children'''	
2 CONT *Elisabeth von Hanau+ d. 25 May 1475
2 CONT *Agnes von Hanau5 d. 22 Nov 1446
2 CONT *Adelheid von Hanau5 d. a 13 Nov 1426
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT 1. [S8160] Unknown author, Europaische Stammtafeln, by Isenburg, Vol. 16, chart 159.
2 CONT 2. [S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. XVII, Tafel 31.
2 CONT 3. [S11600] 40000 Ancestors of the Counts of Paris, 20-103.
2 CONT 4. [S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XVII, Tafel 31.
2 CONT 5. [S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XVI, Tafel 159.
2 CONT From: https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p920.htm#i27622
2 CONT
2 CONT ___________________________
2 CONT ==Elisabeth von Ziegenhain1 
2 CONT '''F, #649040, d. 1 December 1431'''
2 CONT Last Edited=28 Oct 2014
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.51%
2 CONT '''Elisabeth von Ziegenhain was the daughter''' of Gottfried VIII Graf von Ziegenhain Graf von Nidda and Agnes Prinzessin von Braunschweig-Göttingen.1 '''She married Ulrich V Graf von Hanau in 1379.1 She died on 1 December 1431.''
2 CONC '1
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT 1. [S3268] Hans Harmsen, "re: Chester Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 21 August 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Chester Family."
2 CONT From: https://www.thepeerage.com/p64904.htm#i649040
2 CONT
2 CONT ___________________________
2 CONT ==Elisabeth von Ziegenhain
2 CONT '''Birth	1375'''
2 CONT '''Death	1 Dec 1431 (aged 55–56)'''
2 CONT '''Burial	Kloster Klarenthal'''
2 CONT '''Wiesbaden, Stadtkreis Wiesbaden, Hessen, Germany'''
2 CONT Find a Grave Memorial ID: 158575575
