2 CONT Married: Johann Kämmerer of Worms, named by Dalberg secondly , also known as Johann X. Kämmerer or Johann Hennichin Kämmerer (* around 1345 ; † 9 October 1415 ) was a German nobleman in the service of the Kurpfalz .
2 CONT
2 CONT In the first marriage, the nobleman was married to Elisabeth von Winnenberg († 1397), daughter of the Oppenheimer Reichschulheißen Philipp von Winnenberg; After his death with Anna von Bickenbach († 22 May 1415).
2 CONT
2 CONT The following offspring are known from both compounds:
2 CONT
2 CONT (1st marriage)
2 CONT
