2 CONT
2 CONT (2nd marriage)
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Kämmerer of Worms named by Dalberg († 30 October 1410) Ida Kämmerer of Worms named by Dalberg († 1411) Johann Kämmerer of Worms named by Dalberg († July 2, 1431 in the Battle of Bulgnéville [5] ), his son was Wolf II of Dalbe
2 CONC rg Demudis chamberlain of Worms named by Dalberg († 1455)
