2 CONT >'''Thibaud III, Count of Bar''' Also Count of Mousson, Ferrette, Verdun, Seigneur of Montbeliard, and Landgraf in Alsace. He was born circa 1045 at of Bar-le-Duc, Meuse, France. 
2 CONT >He married '''Ermentrude of Burgundy''', daughter of Guillaume II 'the Great', Comte de Franche Comte, Burgundy, Macon, & Vienne, Lord of Salms and Stephanie de Longwy, in 1076 at of Normandy, France.2 
2 CONT >Thibaud III, Count of Bar died between 2 February 1102 and 1105.
2 CONT >'''Family''': Ermentrude of Burgundy b. c 1060, d. a 8 Mar 1105
