2 CONT *     Renaud I, Count of Bar-le-Duc, Mousson, Brie, & Verdun Founded the Priory of Moncon and the monastery at Rieval. 
2 CONT *He His 1st wife's name is '''unknown'''. He was born circa 1090 at of Bar-le-Duc, Meuse, France. 
2 CONT *He married '''Gisela of Vaudemont''', daughter of Gerhard I, Count Vaudemont and Heilwig of Egisheim, in 1120. 
2 CONT *Renaud I, Count of Bar-le-Duc, Mousson, Brie, & Verdun died on 10 April 1149.
