2 CONC andrie comitis" is named in the Cartulaire de Saint-Bertin[344].  The Genealogia Comitum Flandriæ names "Rodbertum et Philippum" as the two sons of "Rodbertus Barbatus [et] Gertrude", specifying that Philippe was buried at "Bergis
