2 CONT His first wife, '''Swanhilde''', died in 1132, leaving only one daughter:
2 CONT
2 CONT #Laurette of Flanders,[7] who married four times: ''Iwain, Count of Aalst; Henry II, Duke of Limburg; Raoul I of Vermandois, Count of Vermandois; and Henry IV of Luxembourg.'' Laurette finally retired to a nunnery, where she died 
2 CONC in 1170.
