2 CONT Conrad, Count Palatine of the Rhine
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT He married secondly Irmingard of Henneberg, by whom he had three children:
2 CONT
2 CONT #Friedrich (died 3 September before 1189)
2 CONT #Konrad (died probably in 1186), buried in Schönau Abbey
2 CONT #Agnes (died 9 May 1204), buried in St. Marien in Stade; married late 1193 at Burg Stahleck Henry V, Duke of Brunswick (died 28 April 1227), Count Palatine of the Rhine from 1195 to 1212.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry V, Count Palatine of the Rhine
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1193, Henry married Agnes (died 1204), daughter of Conrad, Count Palatine of the Rhine. Around 1209, he married Agnes (died 1248), daughter of Conrad II, Margrave of Lower Lusatia. He had the following children, all from the fi
2 CONC rst marriage:
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry (1197–1214)
2 CONT
2 CONT Irmgard (died 1260), married Herman V, Margrave of Baden-Baden
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes (died 1267), married Otto II Wittelsbach, Duke of Bavaria
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heinrich_(V.)_der_%C3%84ltere_von_Braunschweig
2 CONT
2 CONT =Heinrich (V.) der Ältere von Braunschweig=
2 CONT
2 CONT *Nachkommen [Bearbeiten]
2 CONT *Aus erster Ehe mit '''Agnes von Staufen''' entstammten die Kinder:
2 CONT
2 CONT #'''Heinrich der Jüngere''' (* 1197; † 1214), ∞ 1212 Mathilde von Brabant († 1267)
2 CONT #'''Irmgard Erbin von Pforzheim''' (* um 1202; † 1260), ∞ um 1220 Hermann V. Markgraf von Baden († 1243)
2 CONT #'''Agnes''' (* um 1201; † 1267), ∞ 1222 Otto II. Herzog von Bayern († 1253)
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henry_V,_Count_Palatine_of_the_Rhine
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Henry V, Count Palatine of the Rhine==
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family===
2 CONT
2 CONT *In 1193, Henry married '''Agnes (born 1177, died 1204)''', daughter of '''Conrad, Count Palatine of the Rhine'''. 
2 CONT *Around 1209, he married Agnes (died 1248), daughter of Conrad II, Margrave of Lower Lusatia. 
2 CONT *He had the following children, all '''''from the first marriage''':''
2 CONT #'''Henry''' (1197–1214)
2 CONT #'''Irmgard''' (died 1260), married '''Herman V, Margrave of Baden-Baden'''
2 CONT #'''Agnes''' (died 1267), married '''Otto II Wittelsbach, Duke of Bavaria'''
2 CONT
