1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Jutta von Arscheid (von Born)1,2==
2 CONT
2 CONT Jutta von Born married Sir Heinrich von Arscheid, son of Heinrich von Arscheid and Heilwigis von Schidderich; They had 6 sons (Sir Heinrich; Arnold, Canon at Nivelles; Georg, Prior of St. Gereon at Cologne; Wilhelm; Dietrich, Cano
2 CONC n of St. Gereon at Cologne; & Johann, Abbott of Werden) & 2 daughters (Jutta, wife of Johann I van Isenburg-Arenfels; & Beatrix (Paitza), Canoness of St. Cacilia at Cologne). He also had an illegitimate daughter (Elizabeth, Canone
2 CONC ss of St. Cacilia at Cologne).1,2,3 Jutta von Born died after 1319.4,2
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XVII, Tafel 59.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XXVI, Tafel 108.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. XXIX, Tafel 27C.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4) Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. VII, Tafel 149b.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Husband Sir Heinrich von Arscheid===
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Heinrich von Arscheid married Jutta von Born, daughter of Sir Goswin III, Herr zu Born and (Miss) von Lummen; They had 6 sons (Sir Heinrich; Arnold, Canon at Nivelles; Georg, Prior of St. Gereon at Cologne; Wilhelm; Dietrich, 
2 CONC Canon of St. Gereon at Cologne; & Johann, Abbott of Werden) & 2 daughters (Jutta, wife of Johann I van Isenburg-Arenfels; & Beatrix (Paitza), Canoness of St. Cacilia at Cologne). He also had an illegitimate daughter (Elizabeth, Ca
2 CONC noness of St. Cacilia at Cologne).1,4,3 Sir Heinrich von Arscheid died in 1324.4,3
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XVII, Tafel 59.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. VII, Tafel 149b.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. XXIX, Tafel 27C.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4) Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XXVI, Tafel 108.
2 CONT
