1 NAME Elisabeth I 'Ysabeau' /van Brabant/
2 GIVN Elisabeth I 'Ysabeau'
2 SURN van Brabant
2 NICK Elisabeth van Brabant
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1213
2 ADDR
3 CITY Leuven
3 STAE Flemish Region
3 CTRY Belgium
1 DEAT
2 DATE 23 OCT 1272
2 ADDR
3 CITY Wissel
3 STAE Rheinland-Pfalz
3 CTRY Germany
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.graafschap-middeleeuwen.nl/genealogie/getperson.php?personID=I467&tree=DGidME_01
2 CONT
2 CONT === Elisabeth of Brabant
2 CONT *Female 
2 CONT * died 23 Oct 1273 
2 CONT * Father	Hendrik I, Duke of Brabant 1183-1235 ,   b. 1165,   d. Abt 3 Sep 1235, Köln  (Age 70 years) 
2 CONT *Mother	Marie de France,   b. 1198,   d. 15 Aug 1224  (Age 26 years)  Married	22 Apr 1213 	Soissons 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT From [https://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00012355&tree=LEO Genealogics.Org], retrieved 18 April 2022:
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1	Dietrich von Kleve, Heer van Dinslaken 1230-1242 ,   b. Abt 1214/1215,   d. 24 Mar 1245, Wissel (Age ~ 31 years) Married	1233 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 	
2 CONT * +	1. Mechtild von Kleve,   d. 1304 m Gerhard III de Luxembourg, Seigneur de Durbuy
2 CONT * +	2. Elisabeth von Kleve, m Gerlach I von Isenburg, Herr von Arenfels
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 2	Gerhard von Wassenberg, Seigneur de Sprimont ,   d. Sep 1254  Married	5 Jul 1246 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 	
2 CONT *	1. Elisabeth von Wassenberg, m Gerlach von Isenburg
2 CONT *  	2. Mathilde von Wassenberg, m Gerhard von Durbuy
2 CONT *  	3. Jutta von Wassenberg
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From Medlands, retrieved 18 April 2022:
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/BRABANT,%20LOUVAIN.htm#HenriILotharingiaBrabantdied1235B HENRI de Louvain], son of GODEFROI VII Duke of Lower Lotharingia, Duke of Louvain, Comte de Brabant & his first wife Margareta van Limburg (
2 CONC 1165-Köln 5 Sep 1235, bur Louvain, église collégiale de Saint Pierre).   … He was installed as HENRI I "le Guerroyeur" Duke of Brabant in 1191. The necrology of Brogne records the death "VII Id Sep" of "Henricus dux Lovaniensis"[2
2 CONC 51].   m firstly (contract Antwerp 1179, 1180) MATHILDE de Flandre, daughter of MATHIEU de Flandre, Comte de Boulogne & his wife Marie de Blois ….
2 CONT
2 CONT m secondly (Soissons, Aisne 22 Apr 1213) as her second husband, [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/CAPET.htm#Mariedied1238 MARIE de France], widow of PHILIPPE I “le Noble” Marquis de Namur, daughter of PHILIPPE II "Auguste" King of 
2 CONC France & his third wife Agnes von Andechs-Merano (after 1197-15 Aug 1238, bur Affligen or Louvain, église Saint Pierre).  Duke Henri I & his second wife had two children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 8.         [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/BRABANT,%20LOUVAIN.htm#HenriILotharingiaBrabantdied1235B ELISABETH de Brabant] (-[22 Jan 1260/14 Aug 1266]). … dower[294].  
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT m firstly ([Louvain 19 Mar 1233]) [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/FRANCONIA%20(LOWER%20RHINE).htm#Dietrichdied1245 DIETRICH von Kleve] gt von Dinslaken, son of DIETRICH [IV] "Nust" Graf von Kleve & his first wife Mathilde von Din
2 CONC slaken ([1214]-24 Mar 1244).  Dietrich & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT *a)         MECHTILD von Kleve (-1304). …   m (before 3 Dec 1259) GERARD de Durbuy Seigneur de Roussy et de Villance, son of WALRAM III Duke of Limburg & his second wife Ermensende de Luxembourg (-[12 Nov 1298/29 Dec 1303]). 
2 CONT * b)         ELISABETH von Kleve ….  m secondly (Feb 1246 m (before 5 Jan 1252) GERLACH Herr von Isenburg, son of HEINRICH Herr von Isenburg & his wife Mechtild [von Hochstaden] (-1303 or after). 
2 CONT
2 CONT m secondly (Feb 1246)[http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/LIMBURG.htm#GerhardIVWassenbergdied1255 GERHARD] [IV] von Wassenberg, Seigneur de Sprimont, son of GERHARD [II] von Wassenberg [Limburg] & his wife Beatrix von Merheim (-early 
2 CONC 1255).  He had m firstly BEATRIX von Randerode, daughter of GERHARD [II] Herr von Randerode und Liedberg & his wife --- (-before 2 Feb 1246). Gerhard & his second wife had two children:
2 CONT *(b)       JUTTA von Wassenberg (-after 25 Nov 1258).  "Elisabet domina de Sprimont" granted "Mirmekar" to "Jutta filia nostra", stated to be a minor, with the consent of "Ottoni comiti Gelriæ", by charter dated 25 Nov 1258[144]. 
2 CONT *(c)       GERHARD von Wassenberg ([1254/55]-before 14 Oct 1257).  It is assumed Gerhard [IV]’s second wife gave birth to a son who was given the same name shortly before the death of her husband.  
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marie_of_France,_Duchess_of_Brabant
2 CONT
2 CONT With the death of her first husband, Marie was able to remarry. She married April 22, 1213 in Soissons to Henry I, Duke of Brabant. This was a second marriage for them both, Henry had been widowed three years earlier by his first 
2 CONC wife Mathilde of Flanders.
2 CONT
2 CONT The couple had two daughters:
2 CONT
2 CONT #'''Elizabeth''' (d. October 23, 1272), married in Leuven March 19, 1233 Count Dietrich of Cleves, Lord of Dinslaken (c. 1214–1244), married 1246 Gerhard II, Count of Wassenberg (d. 1255)
2 CONT #Marie, died young
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT *[https://books.google.com/books?id=BuVQNFew_lYC&pg=PA141&lpg=PA141&dq=Elisabeth+de+Cleves+(van+Brabant)&source=bl&ots=b-cVv3jo1A&sig=Ud4oogz8zuZyIzEOvgtvE_nQLEg&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwie08m0xJ7aAhUr_IMKHSIkD5QQ6AEIZjAR#v=onepage&q
2 CONC =Elisabeth%20de%20Cleves%20(van%20Brabant)&f=false BRABANTIA ILLUSTRATA, Continens accuratissimam omnium CASTELLORUM ET ...By Jacques Le Roy]
2 CONT *http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00012355&tree=LEO cites 
2 CONT ** Kwartieren van Hendrik III en Willem de Rijke van Nassau, Geldrop, 1965, Roo van Alderwerelt, G. F. de. nr 359. 
2 CONT * https://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00012354&tree=LEO
