1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Adelaide of Gelre (± 1177 - February 12, 1218) was the daughter of Count Otto I of Gelre and Richardis of Bavaria. They married in 1197 in Stavoren William I of Holland. They had five children: Ricardis, Ada, who a
2 CONC round 1239 abbess of the Abbey was Rijnsburg, Floris, William I. Floris IV who in 1222 succeeded, Otto, Otto III in 1234 as bishop of Utrecht, 
2 CONT
2 CONT Willem. 
2 CONT
2 CONT At her death her husband William took part in the Fifth Crusade.
2 CONT
2 CONT source: 
2 CONT
