2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Poppo I von Weimar, Markgraf von Istria and Hadamut Istrien 
2 CONT * Ulric I (German: Ulrich I.), also Odalric or Udalrich (died 6 March 1070), Count of Weimar-Orlamünde, was margrave of Carniola from 1045 and of Istria from 1060 to his death.
