1 NAME Marie /van Brabant/
2 GIVN Marie
2 SURN van Brabant
2 _MARNM van Brabant
2 NICK Maria of Brabant
1 SEX F
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.graafschap-middeleeuwen.nl/genealogie/getperson.php?personID=I467&tree=DGidME_01
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marie_of_France,_Duchess_of_Brabant
2 CONT
2 CONT With the death of her first husband, Marie was able to remarry. She married April 22, 1213 in Soissons to Henry I, Duke of Brabant. This was a second marriage for them both, Henry had been widowed three years earlier by his first 
2 CONC wife Mathilde of Flanders.
2 CONT
2 CONT The couple had two daughters:
2 CONT
2 CONT #Elizabeth (d. October 23, 1272), married in Leuven March 19, 1233 Count Dietrich of Cleves, Lord of Dinslaken (c. 1214–1244), married 1246 Gerhard II, Count of Wassenberg (d. 1255)
2 CONT #'''Marie, died young'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT * https://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00012353&tree=LEO
