2 CONT Note from FARKAS Mihály László: According the MedLands and EuWeb: Elisabeth ►Szabina's  father wasn't Béla IV., but '''Prince András''' the brother of Béla IV., and son of King András II.   Her mother was '''IELENA Mstislavna'''
