2 CONT
2 CONT Duke Béla of Mačva (? - November, 1272)[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Unnamed daughter (perhaps Anna)[2], wife firstly of Tsar Michael Asen I of Bulgaria, secondly of Tsar Koloman II of Bulgaria[6]
2 CONT
2 CONT Kunigunda of Slavonia (1245-September 9, 1285), wife firstly of King Otakar II of Bohemia, and secondly of Zaviš von Falkenstein-Rosenberg[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Gryfina (? - May 26, 1303/1309), wife of Prince Leszek II of Cracow[2]
