2 CONC 322[1227].  m firstly ENGELHARD [IX] von Weinsberg “Wild-Engelhard”, son of KONRAD [IV] von Weinsberg & his first wife Liutgard von Neuffen (-before 1316).  m secondly (before 13 Nov 1316) POPPO [X] Graf von Henneberg, son of HEIN
2 CONC RICH [II] Graf von Henneberg & his wife Kunigunde --- (-1348). 
2 CONT From: https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/FRANCONIA.htm#HeinrichHohenlohediedafter1207A
