2 CONT '''Kraft III, Graf von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim was born circa 1315 at of Weikersheim, Wuerttemberg, Germany. He married Anna von Leuchtenberg''', daughter of Ulric I, Landgraf von Leuchtenberg and Anna von Nürnberg, '''before 12 Mar
2 CONC ch 1340.1,2 Kraft III, Graf von Hohenlohe-Weikersheim died on 16 November 1371.'''1,2
