1 CONC ly IRMENGARD von Württemberg, daughter of ULRICH I "mit dem Daumen" Graf von Württemberg & his second wife Agnes von Liegnitz [Piast] ([1261/64]-before 1295).  m thirdly ADELHEID von Rieneck, daughter of GERHARD IV Graf von Rienec
1 CONC k (-1299, bur Lichtenthal).  children of first marriage:
1 CONT
