1 CONC  the duke of Lower Lorraine (as Godfrey VII) by appoi ntment in 1139 after the death of Duke Waleran and suceeded his fathe r in 1140.  Upon succession to the Duchy, Henry, Duke of Limbourg, cla imed the Duchy of Lower Lorraine, a
1 CONC nd, when Godfrey came into its poss ession, he sent soldiers into the town of St. Tron.  Godfrey besiegedi t and then proceeded onto the area of Alix.  His career however was cu t short by death after a reign of only two or three 
1 CONC years.
1 CONT
