1 CONT their father died in 1294. Being the younger brother, Louis had no claim to
1 CONT the crown at birth, but he was raised in his brother's court with cousins
1 CONT Frederick and Leopold of Lower Bavaia, from a line destined to extinction in
1 CONT 1340.
